Verse 1:
[G/D]Surely, [D]surely [G/D]the Lord has [Em]been here,
[A7]Surely [G/D]angels [D]still linger near;
[G/D]I [D]hear music [Em/G]soft [G]on my ear,
[D/A]I [A]feel His [Bm]Spirit,
[A7]Ihave [D]no fear.
